      "key": "0f8dd6c",
      "nodeTitle": "task_clean_done",
      "sourceText": "Gut gemacht! Geh zurück und sprich mit dem Herrn am Museumseingang.",
      "sourceEnText": "Well done! Go back and see the gentleman at the museum entrance.",
      "audioFile": "fr_03_0f8dd6c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "alice",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4807,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T19:00:48Z",
      "textHash": "3b754bb7db8e01e039f45478563071a1c03490a92db242e110e706a7a26e7e77"
    },
    {
      "key": "0f92a05",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_guide",
      "sourceText": "Er schrieb sehr berühmte Abenteuerbücher.",
      "sourceEnText": "He wrote very famous adventure BOOKS.",
      "audioFile": "fr_03_0f92a05.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "shelley",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2429,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-24T19:00:19Z",
      "textHash": "ba44ba9429eeaaf062baaf85596f1061930337aeb71b5d71bd29d9251c4577b6"
